    "name": "The Weald",
    "steam_appid": 1397880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397880/extras/f130ae04a8d77ff4861ac58861fbea0c.avif?t=1742418451\" /></div><br><strong>The Weald</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game taking place at the end of the Salem Witch Trials.<br><br>You play as William, a Puritan father who claims to have had a vision showing a place where his missing son might be, and suspects a witch is behind his abduction.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> relying on atmosphere and narrative as opposed to explicit violence.<br></li><li><strong>Photorealistic Graphics</strong> made possible by extensive use of Quixel Megascans models and materials.<br></li><li><strong>Full Spoken Audio</strong> by way of excellent voice actors.<br></li><li><strong>Light Puzzle Solving</strong> using various items, similar to <strong>Point &amp; Click</strong> games, but without tedious pixel hunting or arbitrary puzzles.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397880/extras/f130ae04a8d77ff4861ac58861fbea0c.avif?t=1742418451\" /></div><br><strong>The Weald</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game taking place at the end of the Salem Witch Trials.<br><br>You play as William, a Puritan father who claims to have had a vision showing a place where his missing son might be, and suspects a witch is behind his abduction.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> relying on atmosphere and narrative as opposed to explicit violence.<br></li><li><strong>Photorealistic Graphics</strong> made possible by extensive use of Quixel Megascans models and materials.<br></li><li><strong>Full Spoken Audio</strong> by way of excellent voice actors.<br></li><li><strong>Light Puzzle Solving</strong> using various items, similar to <strong>Point &amp; Click</strong> games, but without tedious pixel hunting or arbitrary puzzles.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Following the last of the Salem Witch Trials, a Puritan father claims to have had a vision showing a place where his missing son might be, and suspects a witch is behind his abduction.",
